{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y的音乐感受描写明显不如X细腻，删掉了不少有辨识度的音色、节奏、力度变化和情绪转折细节。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"作为没读过原文的普通观众，Y的左右分栏更容易形成阅读节奏：左边持续讲清人物在想什么、为什么这样想，右边提供简短的情绪和音乐提示，扫一眼就能抓住当前段落。Y的叙事因果和前后推进也更连贯，尤其是从舍不得、怀疑离开是否正确，到决定先把眼下生活过好，人物的心理变化比较容易跟上。X的优势是音乐感受明显更丰富、更具体，甚至能捕捉细微的演奏变化，但大量感受短句容易分散注意力；如果以边听边扫、理解故事为首要体验，我会选Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e3d8f4b3-e08d-4321-8f0e-5e64e691130a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T172546074588Z", "elapsed_seconds": 22.36, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T17:26:08.442965+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f67866f5d195516e6454cac9479404e6fe5d90f1ae4cd031461aab2c8409d43a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "to